lOOB - fetchEventHandlerAndCreateTMFEvent\\(Object eventSnapshot, String eventType, String eventId\\)#{4}":[84,85],"#EventProcessorUtilOOB- Scoped#EventProcessorUtilOOB - fetchEventHandlerAndCreateTMFEvent\\(Object eventSnapshot, String eventType, String eventId\\)#{5}":[86,269]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":30},{"title":"TMF688 Event Management API User Guide","target":"https://www.tmforum.org/resources/standard/tmf688-event-management-api-user-guide-v4-0-0/","line":47},{"title":"Update","target":"r_Update","line":63},{"title":"Configure trouble ticket notifications using the Producer Event Notification Framework","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/developer-guides/prd_evt_not-dev_gd-cfg_trbl_tkt_not.md","line":88},{"title":"TMF688 Event Management API User Guide","target":"https://www.tmforum.org/resources/standard/tmf688-event-management-api-user-guide-v4-0-0/","line":227},{"title":"update","target":"r_Update","line":268}],"metadata":{"title":"EventProcessorUtilOOB - Scoped","description":"The EventProcessorUtilOOB script include provides methods to construct and publish events on the configured message broker.Constructs a TMF688 compliant payload based on the passed information and publishes the event to the configured publishing platform.Converts the passed raw event object into a TMF-compliant event object by invoking a payload generator based on the event type.Instantiates the HermesEventPublisher class and publishes the passed event payload to the Hermes Kafka message broker.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/EventProcessorUtilOOBScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[51,74],[139,162],[191,195],[219,235]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/EventProcessorUtilOOBScopedAPI.md"},
